<title>UK: SIG buys UK, U.S. firms for 36.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>SIG buys UK, U.S. firms for 36.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insulation and related products distributor SIG Plc said on Wednesday it had bought the roofing products distribution business of Britain's Asphaltic Roofing Supplies Ltd for 25.1 million stg cash.</p>
<p>SIG said it had also bought U.S. insulation products groups Distribution International and Branton Industries for $19 million.</p>
<p>SIG said the three acquisitions totalled 36.4 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
